  "decision_date": "18/10/2022",
  "description": "Erection of a rear roof dormer extension with juliet balcony, refurbishment and extension of existing single storey rear extension, erection of a basement for incidental purposes, installation of high level side window and installation of front and rear lightwells to the house with associated internal alterations.",
  "site_name": null,
